  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Serpent’s Brood",
    "summary": "**HARLEQUINS VEHICLE** and **HARLEQUINS MOUNTED** models in your army have **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)** on their weapons. Also, when a **HARLEQUINS** unit of yours disembarks from a **TRANSPORT**, its weapons have **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)** until the turn ends.",
